* ELM2021 Vize Ornegi 5: BJT Gerilim Boluculu Ongerilimlendirme (Thevenin Analizi)
* Boylestad Ornek 4.10: Vcc=18V, R1=82k, R2=22k, Rc=5.6k, Re=1.2k, beta=50
* Yaklasik yontem sarti (beta*Re >= 10*R2 -> 60k < 220k) saglanmaz, Thevenin zorunludur!
* Beklenen El Hesabi: Ib ~ 39.6 uA, Ic ~ 1.98 mA, Vce ~ 4.49 V

.model Q_SINAV NPN(BF=50 VAF=1e6 IS=1e-15 NF=1)

Vcc vcc 0 DC 18
R1 vcc b 82k
R2 b 0 22k
Rc vcc c 5.6k
Re e 0 1.2k
Q1 c b e Q_SINAV

.control
  op
  print v(b) v(e) v(c) v(c)-v(e)
  show q1 : ib : ic : vce
.endc

.end

